flowchart LR
    Owner[Human owner] -->|types question| UI[Streamlit PawPal+ app]
    UI -->|question + current owner state| Assistant[PawPal AI assistant]

    subgraph Data[Live PawPal data]
        OwnerState[Owner]
        Pets[Pets]
        Tasks[Care tasks]
        OwnerState --> Pets --> Tasks
    end

    Assistant -->|retrieves relevant pet and task records| Retriever[Task retriever]
    Retriever -->|ranked task context| Prompt[Grounded prompt]
    Tasks -->|actual task data| Retriever
    Prompt --> Generator[AI answer generator]
    Generator -->|answer based only on retrieved context| Guardrail[Grounding guardrail]
    Guardrail -->|answer + cited pet/task details| UI
    Guardrail -->|fallback when AI is unavailable or context is missing| Fallback[Deterministic safe response]
    Fallback --> UI

    subgraph Checks[Quality checks]
        Tests[Automated pytest tests]
        Human[Human review of answer and retrieved records]
    end

    Tests -->|checks retrieval, grounding, and fallback| Assistant
    Human -->|checks accuracy and usefulness| UI

    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b58105,color:#3d2f00
    classDef ai fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#12344d
    classDef data fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#173b1a
    class Owner,Human human
    class Assistant,Retriever,Prompt,Generator,Guardrail,Fallback ai
    class OwnerState,Pets,Tasks data
